#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: lfs-en/chapter06/binutils-pass2.xml:44
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Binutils"
msgstr "Instalação do Binutils"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter06/binutils-pass2.xml:52
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Binutils building system relies on an shipped libtool copy to link against "
"internal static libraries, but the libiberty and zlib copies shipped in the "
"package do not use libtool.  This inconsistency may cause produced binaries "
"mistakenly linked against libraries from the host distro.  Work around this "
"issue:"
msgstr ""
"O sistema de construção do \"Binutils\" depende de uma cópia enviada da "
"\"libtool\" para vincular-se a bibliotecas estáticas internas, mas as cópias"
" \"libiberty\" e \"zlib\" enviadas no pacote não usam a \"libtool\". Essa "
"inconsistência possivelmente cause binários produzidos vinculados "
"erroneamente a bibliotecas originárias da distribuição anfitriã. Contorne "
"esse problema:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter06/binutils-pass2.xml:58
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput remap=\"pre\">sed '6031s/$add_dir//' -i ltmain.sh</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">sed '6031s/$add_dir//' -i ltmain.sh</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter06/binutils-pass2.xml:60
#, xml-text
msgid "Create a separate build directory again:"
msgstr "Crie um diretório de construção separado novamente:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter06/binutils-pass2.xml:62
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">mkdir -v build\n"
"cd       build</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">mkdir -v build\n"
"cd      build</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter06/binutils-pass2.xml:65
#, xml-text
msgid "Prepare Binutils for compilation:"
msgstr "Prepare o Binutils para compilação:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter06/binutils-pass2.xml:67
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"configure\">../configure                   \\\n"
"    --prefix=/usr              \\\n"
"    --build=$(../config.guess) \\\n"
"    --host=$LFS_TGT            \\\n"
"    --disable-nls              \\\n"
"    --enable-shared            \\\n"
"    --enable-gprofng=no        \\\n"
"    --disable-werror           \\\n"
"    --enable-64-bit-bfd        \\\n"
"    --enable-new-dtags         \\\n"
"    --enable-default-hash-style=gnu</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"configure\">../configure                   \\\n"
"    --prefix=/usr              \\\n"
"    --build=$(../config.guess) \\\n"
"    --host=$LFS_TGT            \\\n"
"    --disable-nls              \\\n"
"    --enable-shared            \\\n"
"    --enable-gprofng=no        \\\n"
"    --disable-werror           \\\n"
"    --enable-64-bit-bfd        \\\n"
"    --enable-new-dtags         \\\n"
"    --enable-default-hash-style=gnu</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><variablelist><title>
#: lfs-en/chapter06/binutils-pass2.xml:80
#, xml-text
msgid "The meaning of the new configure options:"
msgstr "O significado das novas opções de configuração:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: lfs-en/chapter06/binutils-pass2.xml:83
#, xml-text
msgid "<parameter>--enable-shared</parameter>"
msgstr "<parameter>--enable-shared</parameter>"

#. type: Content of:
#. <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter06/binutils-pass2.xml:85
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Builds <filename class=\"libraryfile\">libbfd</filename> as a shared "
"library."
msgstr ""
"Constrói <filename class=\"libraryfile\">libbfd</filename> como uma "
"biblioteca compartilhada."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: lfs-en/chapter06/binutils-pass2.xml:92
#, xml-text
msgid "<parameter>--enable-64-bit-bfd</parameter>"
msgstr "<parameter>--enable-64-bit-bfd</parameter>"

#. type: Content of:
#. <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter06/binutils-pass2.xml:94
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Enables 64-bit support (on hosts with smaller word sizes).  This may not be "
"needed on 64-bit systems, but it does no harm."
msgstr ""
"Habilita suporte de 64 bits (em anfitriões com tamanhos de palavra mais "
"estreitos). Isso possivelmente não seja necessário em sistemas de 64 bits, "
"porém não causa dano."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter06/binutils-pass2.xml:101
#, xml-text
msgid "Compile the package:"
msgstr "Compile o pacote:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter06/binutils-pass2.xml:103
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput remap=\"make\">make</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput remap=\"make\">make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter06/binutils-pass2.xml:105
#, xml-text
msgid "Install the package:"
msgstr "Instale o pacote:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter06/binutils-pass2.xml:107
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput remap=\"install\">make DESTDIR=$LFS install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput remap=\"install\">make DESTDIR=$LFS install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter06/binutils-pass2.xml:109
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Remove the libtool archive files because they are harmful for cross "
"compilation, and remove unnecessary static libraries:"
msgstr ""
"Remova os arquivos de arquivamento da libtool, pois eles são danosos para "
"compilação cruzada e remove bibliotecas estáticas desnecessárias:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter06/binutils-pass2.xml:112
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"install\">rm -v $LFS/usr/lib/lib{bfd,ctf,ctf-"
"nobfd,opcodes,sframe}.{a,la}</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"install\">rm -v $LFS/usr/lib/lib{bfd,ctf,ctf-"
"nobfd,opcodes,sframe}.{a,la}</userinput>"

